zero is function returns 42
identity is function x returns x
add is function x y returns x+y
square is function x returns x*x

output is zero()
output is identity(0)
output is identity(-5)
output is add(-10,5)
output is square(0)
output is square(-4)

a is square(5)
a is square(6)
output is a

b = square(7)
b = square(8)
output is b
